<title>ITALY: Italy's total reserves 108.908 trln lire in May.</title>
<headline>Italy's total reserves 108.908 trln lire in May.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's total reserves stood at 108.908 trillion lire at end-May, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The office gave the following data in trillions of lire:</p>
<p>				    May 97     April 97	 May 96</p>
<p>    Total reserves	    108.908	107.334     106.345</p>
<p>    Total assets		110.799	109.129     110.243</p>
<p>     (of which in gold)	37.491	 37.491	39.542</p>
<p>    Liabilities		   1.891	  1.795	 3.898</p>
<p>    (of which short-term)     0.238	  0.154	 2.329</p>
</text>
